WEBVTT

00:38:29.813 --> 00:38:32.582
and then you let go
of the myth of control,

00:38:32.606 --> 00:38:37.055
you'll find that, I find that if I even
say that sentence,

00:38:37.079 --> 00:38:38.397
"I'm losing control,"

00:38:38.421 --> 00:38:39.666
and then I remind myself,

00:38:39.690 --> 00:38:41.952
"You never had control,
all you had was anxiety,

00:38:41.976 --> 00:38:43.984
and that's what you're having right now."

00:38:44.008 --> 00:38:45.826
So you're not letting go of anything.

00:38:45.850 --> 00:38:48.913
Surrender means letting go
of something you never even had.

00:38:48.937 --> 00:38:51.985
So there's an awakening
that's happening right now,

00:38:52.009 --> 00:38:54.682
where what's happening
is not that you're losing control.

00:38:54.706 --> 00:38:56.826
What's happening is that,
for the first time,

00:38:56.850 --> 00:38:58.921
you're noticing that you never had it.

00:38:58.945 --> 00:39:02.143
And the world is doing its job.